    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I love math because it’s practical and creative—like coding. I use it for problem-solving in games and baking. It’s not intimidating; it’s a tool to build things, from algorithms to recipes. My parents’ different backgrounds (one with a PhD, one with primary school) taught me to appreciate both simplicity and depth.",
