    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes! I used a coding AI to debug my math projects. It helped me visualize equations and spot errors quickly. The experience was positive—no frustration, just clear, step-by-step guidance. It’s great for learning complex topics without feeling overwhelmed.",
